DXVK 601930949d111edbbcf9dd463948426d9f8f6ddd

An unbound ClearRenderTargetView can remain deferred when Present uses
the external blitter. endCurrentCommands suspends the pass and only
prepares shared images. End the pass without suspension before external
rendering to resolve pending clears and shader-readable layouts. This
applies to every external-rendering caller, without application readback.

--- a/src/dxvk/dxvk_context.cpp
+++ b/src/dxvk/dxvk_context.cpp
@@ -202,7 +202,9 @@
 
 
   Rc<DxvkCommandList> DxvkContext::beginExternalRendering() {
-    // Flush and invalidate everything
+    // External rendering samples ordinary images outside our barrier tracker.
+    // Resolve deferred clears and restore shader-readable layouts first.
+    endCurrentPass(false);
     endCurrentCommands();
     beginCurrentCommands();
 
